.TH LIBRDP-X11-ADMIN 1 "2026-07-15" "librdp 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
librdp-x11-admin \- query and display RDS session inventory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B librdp-x11-admin
.BI --endpoint " url"
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B librdp-x11-admin
queries a WinRM administration endpoint through the public librdp Admin API and
prints the returned session inventory. By default it also opens a small X11
window containing the same inventory. Use
.B --no-window
for scripts, CI jobs, and non-interactive checks.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --endpoint " url"
WinRM endpoint URL, for example
.BR http://host:5985/wsman
or
.BR https://host:5986/wsman .
.TP
.BI --user " name"
Endpoint user name.
.TP
.BI --password " value"
Endpoint password.
.TP
.BI --password-env " name"
Read the endpoint password from the named environment variable.
.TP
.BI --domain " name"
Authentication domain.
.TP
.BI --resource-uri " uri"
WinRM resource URI to enumerate. If omitted, the default targets logon session
inventory.
.TP
.BI --timeout " ms"
Connection and request timeout in milliseconds.
.TP
.B --insecure-lab
Disable TLS certificate verification for explicitly controlled lab endpoints.
Do not use this option for production endpoints.
.TP
.B --no-window
Do not open an X11 window; print the inventory and exit.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print usage.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
librdp-x11-admin --endpoint http://server:5985/wsman --user Marco --password-env RDS_PASSWORD --no-window
librdp-x11-admin --endpoint https://server:5986/wsman --user Marco --domain LAB
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR librdp (7),
.BR librdp-api (7)
